From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nadelacruz-00 <323917690+nadelacruz-00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:49:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/a6xx: defer the GMU probe until its GX power domain
 is ready

a6xx_gmu_init() treats the "gx" power domain as optional and carries on
when attaching it fails. When the domain is described but its provider
has not probed yet, the attach returns -EPROBE_DEFER and the GMU comes
up without gmu->gxpd for good, so hang recovery can never collapse GX.

On the OnePlus Pad 3 the provider is gxclkctl-kaanapali, built as a
module (SM_GPUCC_8750=m), while drm/msm is built in and the command
line has fw_devlink=off, so nothing orders the two. Whether GX attached
depended on module load timing: with erhai_defconfig the GMU lost the
race by a few milliseconds:

  3d37000.gmu: GX power domain not available (-EPROBE_DEFER): hang recovery cannot collapse GX

Defer the GMU like the qmp_get() deferral just above, so the GPU binds
once the domain exists. A GMU without a "gx" domain in its node still
gets NULL and probes as before.

Tested on a OnePlus Pad 3 (SM8750) with erhai_defconfig: without this
change one boot came up with "genpd:1" missing and the warning above;
with it the GMU attaches both domains, the GPU binds about 10 ms later
than before (2.628 s against 2.617 s), and IGT msm_recovery gpu-fault
recovers.

Signed-off-by: nadelacruz-00 <323917690+nadelacruz-00@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
index baf99dc9bcc..21b219fbfae 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
@@ -2464,6 +2464,10 @@ int a6xx_gmu_init(struct a6xx_gpu *a6xx_gpu, struct device_node *node)
 	 * crash
 	 */
 	gmu->gxpd = dev_pm_domain_attach_by_name(gmu->dev, "gx");
+	if (PTR_ERR_OR_ZERO(gmu->gxpd) == -EPROBE_DEFER) {
+		ret = -EPROBE_DEFER;
+		goto detach_gxpd;
+	}
 	if (adreno_is_a8xx(adreno_gpu) && IS_ERR(gmu->gxpd))
 		dev_warn(gmu->dev,
 			 "GX power domain not available (%pe): hang recovery cannot collapse GX\n",
